Package: rhodep-gpu-opencl
Version: 2
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: rhodep port
Depends: mesa-opencl-icd, clinfo
Description: OpenCL on the Adreno 619 via rusticl for Motorola rhodep
 Mesa's rusticl provides OpenCL on freedreno, but it ships disabled and only
 turns on when RUSTICL_ENABLE names the driver. Without it clinfo reports zero
 platforms and hashcat says "No devices found/left" even though the GPU works.
 This sets RUSTICL_ENABLE=freedreno system-wide so OpenCL consumers see FD619.
